OL,3,GNEWSANew leak forces closure of canal
OL,4,Anear collapse site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new leak has forced the temporary
OL,7,Fclosure of a stretch of canal close to
OL,8,Fwhere a major collapse happened just
OL,9,Fbefore Christmas last year.
OL,11,FThe closure, from Monday, of the
OL,12,FLlangollen Canal, in Whitchurch,
OL,13,FShropshire, comes nearly nine months
OL,14,Fafter millions of litres of water were
OL,15,Fsent cascading onto nearby land, in the
OL,16,Fearly hours of 22 December, leaving
OL,17,Fboat owners in disbelief.
OL,19,FWork by the Canal and River Trust (CRT)
OL,20,Fhas been ongoing across the year, but a
OL,21,Fwet patch had been discovered, it said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
