OL,3,GNEWSANew leak forces closure of canal
OL,4,Anear collapse site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Whitchurch Waterway Trust (WWT)
OL,7,Fsaid the leak is thought to be from the
OL,8,Fcanal to the south of the works, which
OL,9,Fmeans that part of the canal will have
OL,10,Fto be temporarily closed by the CRT.
